1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
一说吃辣，先想到四川
Spicy? You think Sichuan first.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
可最能吃辣，它只排第五
But for spice, it's only fifth.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
四川的辣，一半是"麻"
Half of it isn't heat — it's numb.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
花椒的麻，比辣椒更老
The peppercorn came long before chili.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
辣椒明末才传进中国
Chili reached China only ~400 years ago.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
在那之前，川人靠花椒
Before that: peppercorn, not chili.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
一口下去，舌头先发麻
One bite — your tongue tingles first.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
成都、自贡，最会调这口
Chengdu and Zigong master the mix.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
麻得巴适，辣是配角
"Bāshì" numb — heat just follows.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
那到底谁最辣？下集见
So who is really spiciest? Next.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,600
你觉得四川该排第几？评论区
Where would you rank Sichuan? Comment.
